{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
CUSTOM STARTER PACK (templates/product.custom-starter-pack.json)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Custom Starter Pack: the customer picks a player (bumper colour = the pack product's variants) and any N audiobooks
from one collection, then adds ONE line to the basket: the pack variant with the hidden property `_pack_books`
(book variant IDs) and a visible "Books" property (titles, for the basket). The Mix and Match Packs app
(teedublu/VBPackApp, Codek Ltd partner org) splits that line at checkout into the player in that colour and the
books, each at its pack price, so orders, stock and Zoho see the real items.

Used as the pack product's own template, so the product page IS the builder: there is no plain "Add to cart" (the
pack can't be bought without books; Shopify refuses it because the pack variants require components).

* Pack price: the selected pack variant's price, read live. "Worth" = the matching player variant's price (from
  "Player product", matched by variant title, e.g. Orange) + the chosen books' own prices.
* Books: every product in "Books collection" (loaded in the browser from /collections/<handle>/products.json, so
  the collection must be on the Online Store channel). This must be the same collection the app's book list is
  built from, or the app will refuse a book the page offers. Sold-out books can't be picked.
* "Books per pack" must match the app's pack settings (3 for the £79.99 pack).
* Filters: search (title, author tags), "♥ Liked" (books the visitor has hearted anywhere on the site,
  assets/saved-books.js; always shown so people learn they can like books and find them here, with the count; empty
  state explains it), age chips. Each book card has the site's heart too (save-book-button), so liking works here.
* Summary: a row of pictures, the player in the chosen colour then one cover per book (titles on hover and for
  screen readers, × to remove); an empty slot is a "+ Book 2" tile that jumps to the book list.
* Links can preselect books: ?books=<handle>,<handle> or ?book=<handle> (e.g. "Start a pack with this book").
Script: assets/custom-starter-pack.js (logic tested with node). Styles: voxblock.css "CUSTOM STARTER PACK".
PostHog: custom_starter_pack_book { action, book, count }, custom_starter_pack_add { colour, books, worth, price },
custom_starter_pack_error { reason }.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign s = section.settings
  assign pack = product
  if s.pack_product != blank
    assign pack = s.pack_product
  endif
  assign required = s.books_required
  assign heading = s.heading | default: pack.title
  assign player = s.player_product
  assign first_variant = pack.selected_or_first_available_variant
  assign collection_handle = s.books_collection.handle | default: 'pack-eligible-audiobooks'
-%}

{%- capture variants_json -%}
  [
  {%- for v in pack.variants -%}
    {%- liquid
      assign player_variant = blank
      if player != blank
        for pv in player.variants
          if pv.title == v.title
            assign player_variant = pv
            break
          endif
        endfor
      endif
    -%}
    {%- liquid
      assign player_image = player_variant.featured_image | default: player.featured_image | default: v.featured_image
    -%}
    {"id":{{ v.id }},"title":{{ v.title | json }},"price":{{ v.price }},"available":{{ v.available }},"playerPrice":{% if player_variant != blank %}{{ player_variant.price }}{% else %}0{% endif %},"playerImage":{% if player_image != blank %}{{ player_image | image_url: width: 240 | json }}{% else %}""{% endif %}}{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
  {%- endfor -%}
  ]
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- capture messages_json -%}
  {
    "chooseMore": {{ s.choose_more_text | json }},
    "chooseOneMore": {{ s.choose_one_more_text | json }},
    "add": {{ s.button_text | json }},
    "adding": "Adding…",
    "full": {{ s.full_text | json }},
    "added": "[book] added. [count] of [total] chosen.",
    "removed": "[book] removed. [count] of [total] chosen.",
    "soldOut": "Sold out",
    "addBook": "Add",
    "addedBook": "Added",
    "noResults": {{ s.no_results_text | json }},
    "liked": {{ s.liked_label | json }},
    "likedEmpty": {{ s.liked_empty_text | json }},
    "save": "Like [book]",
    "loadError": "Sorry, the audiobooks didn't load. Please refresh the page.",
    "cartError": {{ s.cart_error_text | json }},
    "worth": {{ s.worth_text | json }},
    "details": "About this book",
    "remove": "Remove [book]",
    "slot": "Book [n]",
    "pickSlot": "Choose book [n]",
    "player": "Voxblock player, [colour]"
  }
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- render 'section-spacing-collapsing' -%}

<div class="custom-starter-pack">
  <div {% render 'section-properties' %}>
    <custom-starter-pack class="custom-starter-pack__inner"
      data-collection="{{ collection_handle | escape }}"
      data-required="{{ required }}"
      data-age-filters="{{ s.age_filters | escape }}"
      data-variants="{{ variants_json | strip_newlines | escape }}"
      data-messages="{{ messages_json | strip_newlines | escape }}"
      data-currency="{{ cart.currency.iso_code }}"
      data-product-url="{{ pack.url }}">

      <header class="custom-starter-pack__header">
        {%- if s.eyebrow != blank -%}<p class="subheading custom-starter-pack__eyebrow">{{ s.eyebrow | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
        <h1 class="h2 custom-starter-pack__heading">{{ heading | escape }}</h1>
        {%- if s.intro != blank -%}
          <div class="prose custom-starter-pack__intro">{{ s.intro | replace: '[books]', required }}</div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </header>

      <div class="custom-starter-pack__layout">
        <div class="custom-starter-pack__main">

          {%- comment -%} Step 1: bumper colour = pack variant {%- endcomment -%}
          <fieldset class="custom-starter-pack__step custom-starter-pack__colours">
            <legend class="h5 custom-starter-pack__step-title"><span class="custom-starter-pack__step-number">1</span> {{ s.colour_heading | escape }}</legend>
            <div class="custom-starter-pack__colour-list">
              {%- for v in pack.variants -%}
                {%- liquid
                  assign colour_image = blank
                  if player != blank
                    for pv in player.variants
                      if pv.title == v.title
                        assign colour_image = pv.featured_image
                        break
                      endif
                    endfor
                  endif
                  assign colour_image = colour_image | default: v.featured_image
                  assign colour_key = v.title | handleize
                -%}
                <label class="custom-starter-pack__colour custom-starter-pack__colour--{{ colour_key }}">
                  <input type="radio" name="pack-colour-{{ section.id }}" value="{{ v.id }}" {% if v.id == first_variant.id %}checked{% endif %} {% unless v.available %}disabled{% endunless %} data-pack-colour>
                  <span class="custom-starter-pack__colour-card">
                    {%- if colour_image != blank -%}
                      {{- colour_image | image_url: width: 240 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', sizes: '120px', class: 'custom-starter-pack__colour-image', alt: '' -}}
                    {%- else -%}
                      <span class="custom-starter-pack__colour-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    {%- endif -%}
                    <span class="custom-starter-pack__colour-name">{{ v.title | escape }}{% unless v.available %} ({{ 'product.general.sold_out_button' | t }}){% endunless %}</span>
                  </span>
                </label>
              {%- endfor -%}
            </div>
          </fieldset>

          {%- comment -%} Step 2: books {%- endcomment -%}
          <section class="custom-starter-pack__step custom-starter-pack__books" aria-labelledby="pack-books-{{ section.id }}">
            <h2 class="h5 custom-starter-pack__step-title" id="pack-books-{{ section.id }}"><span class="custom-starter-pack__step-number">2</span> {{ s.books_heading | replace: '[books]', required | escape }}</h2>

            <div class="custom-starter-pack__filters">
              <label class="custom-starter-pack__search">
                <span class="sr-only">{{ s.search_placeholder | escape }}</span>
                <input type="search" class="input" placeholder="{{ s.search_placeholder | escape }}" autocomplete="off" data-pack-search>
              </label>
              <div class="custom-starter-pack__chips" role="group" aria-label="Filter audiobooks" data-pack-chips></div>
            </div>

            {%- comment -%}The theme's heart icon, cloned by the script into the Liked chip and each book's heart{%- endcomment -%}
            <template data-pack-heart>{%- render 'icon' with 'picto-love', width: 20, height: 20 -%}</template>

            <ul class="custom-starter-pack__grid" role="list" data-pack-grid aria-busy="true">
              <li class="custom-starter-pack__loading">Loading audiobooks…</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="custom-starter-pack__empty" data-pack-empty hidden></p>
            <noscript><p class="custom-starter-pack__note">Choosing books needs JavaScript switched on.</p></noscript>
          </section>
        </div>

        {%- comment -%} Summary: sticky beside the books on desktop, a bar at the bottom on phones {%- endcomment -%}
        <aside class="custom-starter-pack__summary" aria-label="Your pack">
          <div class="custom-starter-pack__summary-card">
            <p class="h5 custom-starter-pack__summary-title">{{ s.summary_heading | escape }}</p>
            <ol class="custom-starter-pack__slots" role="list" style="--pack-tiles: {{ required | plus: 1 }}" data-pack-slots>
              <li class="custom-starter-pack__slot custom-starter-pack__slot--player"></li>
              {%- for i in (1..required) -%}
                <li class="custom-starter-pack__slot is-empty"><span class="custom-starter-pack__slot-pick"><span class="custom-starter-pack__slot-plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span>Book {{ i }}</span></li>
              {%- endfor -%}
            </ol>
            <p class="custom-starter-pack__includes">{{ s.includes_text | escape }}</p>
            <div class="custom-starter-pack__price">
              <span class="custom-starter-pack__amount" data-pack-price>{{ first_variant.price | money }}</span>
              <span class="custom-starter-pack__worth" data-pack-worth hidden></span>
            </div>
            <button type="button" class="button button--lg custom-starter-pack__add" data-pack-add disabled>
              {{- s.choose_more_text | replace: '[n]', required | escape -}}
            </button>
            <p class="custom-starter-pack__status" role="alert" data-pack-status></p>
            <p class="sr-only" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-pack-announce></p>
            {%- if s.trust_text != blank -%}<p class="custom-starter-pack__trust">{{ s.trust_text | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </custom-starter-pack>
  </div>
</div>

<script type="module" src="{{ 'custom-starter-pack.js' | asset_url }}"></script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Custom starter pack",
  "class": "shopify-section--custom-starter-pack",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "product", "id": "pack_product", "label": "Pack product", "info": "Leave empty on the pack's own product page (it uses that product). Its variants are the bumper colours." },
    { "type": "product", "id": "player_product", "label": "Player product", "info": "Gives each colour's picture and the player's own price for the \"worth\" line. Matched by variant title (Orange, Green…)." },
    { "type": "collection", "id": "books_collection", "label": "Books collection", "info": "Must be the same collection as the app's book list, and on the Online Store channel." },
    { "type": "range", "id": "books_required", "label": "Books per pack", "min": 1, "max": 6, "step": 1, "default": 3, "info": "Must match the app's pack settings." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Text" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "Customise your pack" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "info": "Leave empty to use the product title." },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "intro", "label": "Intro", "default": "<p>Choose your player and any [books] audiobooks. You get the Voxblock player in its bumper, the charging cable and your [books] books, all for one price.</p>", "info": "[books] = books per pack." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "colour_heading", "label": "Step 1 heading", "default": "Choose a player" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "books_heading", "label": "Step 2 heading", "default": "Choose any [books] audiobooks" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "search_placeholder", "label": "Search box", "default": "Search by title or author" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "age_filters", "label": "Age filters", "default": "Under 5 = under 5, 3-5\n5 to 8 = 5-8\n8 to 10 = 8-10\n10+ = 10 plus", "info": "One per line: label = product tags (comma separated). Leave empty for no age filters." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "liked_label", "label": "Liked filter", "default": "Liked", "info": "Always shown next to All, with the heart and a count of liked books that can go in the pack." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "liked_empty_text", "label": "Liked filter, nothing liked yet", "default": "Tap the heart on any audiobook, here or anywhere on the site, and it will be waiting here when you come back to build your pack." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "no_results_text", "label": "No results", "default": "No audiobooks match. Try another search or filter." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "summary_heading", "label": "Summary heading", "default": "Your pack" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "includes_text", "label": "Included line", "default": "Player with bumper, charging cable and your audiobooks" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "worth_text", "label": "Worth line", "default": "Worth [worth], you save [save]", "info": "[worth] = player + books at their own prices. Hidden when there is no saving." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "choose_more_text", "label": "Button while choosing", "default": "Choose [n] more books", "info": "[n] = books still to choose." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "choose_one_more_text", "label": "Button with one to go", "default": "Choose 1 more book" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "button_text", "label": "Add button", "default": "Add pack to basket" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "full_text", "label": "Pack full message", "default": "Your pack is full. Remove a book to swap it." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cart_error_text", "label": "Basket error", "default": "Sorry, that pack couldn't be added. One of the books may have just sold out, so please check your choices and try again." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "trust_text", "label": "Trust line", "default": "No downloads, no subscription, no screen." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Colours" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "full_width", "label": "Full width", "default": true },
    { "type": "color", "id": "background", "label": "Background" },
    { "type": "color_background", "id": "background_gradient", "label": "Background gradient" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "text_color", "label": "Text" }
  ],
  "presets": [ { "name": "Custom starter pack" } ]
}
{% endschema %}
